ent will be subject to a background check by an independent investigation firm in accordance with the Fair Credit Reporting Act. Job Opportunities Please follow the instructions in the job listing in order to apply. Proceed to the Faculty Job Listing Please follow the instructions in the job listing in order to apply. Proceed to the Staff Job Listing If required, you may complete an Employment Application , and submit to the contact name or department on the job listing. Access the Lafayette College Security Report Lafayette College Plan a Visit Contact (610) 330-5000 Connect With Us Twitter Facebook YouTube Instagram LinkedIn Directory Offices & Resources College Store Employment Virtual Tour Take the Next Step Apply Visit Campus Request Info 730 High St, Easton, PA 18042 © 2026 Terms of Use Privacy Policy Non-Discrimination Policy Close About Us Academics Campus Life Admissions & Aid Directions The College Shuttle Emergency Contact Directory Library Catalog Make A Gift Our Pulse Athletics The Arts News Events Giving Families Alumni Students, Faculty, & Staff Our People"
